# 🎤 OPIc Experience Question - Day37

## Question

Tell me about a memorable experience you had with your friends.

What happened?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- When it happened
- Where you were
- Who you were with
- What happened
- How you felt
- How the experience ended
- Why you still remember it

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> I remember when...

Also try to use:

> At first,...

> Then,...

> After that,...

> In the end,...

> I still remember it because...

---

## Recommended Structure

**I remember when...**

↓

It happened when...

↓

At first,...

↓

Then,...

↓

After that,...

↓

**In the end,...**

↓

**I still remember it because...**
